* Mutant: every comparator has vin and its ladder tap swapped, so the thermometer code is inverted.
* Expected: fails the nominal transfer gate.

.subckt fa_inv a y vdd vss
XP y a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XN y a vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=2 nf=1
.ends fa_inv

.subckt fa_clkbuf a y vdd vss
* small input stage (the only load on the clk pin), then a 4x-finger driver for the comparator bank
XP1 m a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=3 nf=1
XN1 m a vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1.5 nf=1
XP2 y m vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=24 nf=4
XN2 y m vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=12 nf=2
.ends fa_clkbuf

.subckt fa_nand2 a b y vdd vss
XP1 y a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XP2 y b vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XN1 y a nx vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XN2 nx b vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
.ends fa_nand2

.subckt fa_nand4 a b c d y vdd vss
XP1 y a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XP2 y b vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XP3 y c vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XP4 y d vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XN1 y a n1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XN2 n1 b n2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XN3 n2 c n3 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XN4 n3 d vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
.ends fa_nand4

.subckt fa_comp clk vinp vinn outp outn vdd vss
* StrongARM latch: outp/outn precharge high, outn falls when vinp > vinn
XTAIL tail clk vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=32 nf=8
XIN1 dx vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.18 w=16 nf=4
XIN2 dy vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.18 w=16 nf=4
XNL1 outn outp dx vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XNL2 outp outn dy vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPL1 outn outp vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPL2 outp outn vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPC1 outn clk vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPC2 outp clk vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPC3 dx clk vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPC4 dy clk vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
.ends fa_comp

.subckt fa_nor2 a b y vdd vss
XP1 y a px vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XP2 px b vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XN1 y a vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=2 nf=1
XN2 y b vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=2 nf=1
.ends fa_nor2

.subckt fa_hold outp outn q vdd vss
* Both comparator outputs go through equal inverters, so the comparator sees the same load whatever the
* latch holds (a latch gate on the comparator output would load it by state and add hysteresis).
* NOR SR latch: holds while both inverter outputs are low (comparator precharge); q = 1 when outn fell.
XIS outn s vdd vss fa_inv
XIR outp r vdd vss fa_inv
XG1 r qb q vdd vss fa_nor2
XG2 s q qb vdd vss fa_nor2
.ends fa_hold

.subckt flash_adc_3bit vss vdd vrefn vrefp clk vin b2 b1 b0
* ---- clock buffer ----
XCK clk ck vdd vss fa_clkbuf
* ---- reference resistor ladder ----
RL1 t1 vrefn 500
RL2 t2 t1 500
RL3 t3 t2 500
RL4 t4 t3 500
RL5 t5 t4 500
RL6 t6 t5 500
RL7 t7 t6 500
RL8 vrefp t7 500
CT1 t1 vss 2p
CT2 t2 vss 2p
CT3 t3 vss 2p
CT4 t4 vss 2p
CT5 t5 vss 2p
CT6 t6 vss 2p
CT7 t7 vss 2p
* ---- comparator bank with SR hold latches (q_k high when vin > t_k) ----
XC1 ck t1 vin cp1 cn1 vdd vss fa_comp
XH1 cp1 cn1 q1 vdd vss fa_hold
XC2 ck t2 vin cp2 cn2 vdd vss fa_comp
XH2 cp2 cn2 q2 vdd vss fa_hold
XC3 ck t3 vin cp3 cn3 vdd vss fa_comp
XH3 cp3 cn3 q3 vdd vss fa_hold
XC4 ck t4 vin cp4 cn4 vdd vss fa_comp
XH4 cp4 cn4 q4 vdd vss fa_hold
XC5 ck t5 vin cp5 cn5 vdd vss fa_comp
XH5 cp5 cn5 q5 vdd vss fa_hold
XC6 ck t6 vin cp6 cn6 vdd vss fa_comp
XH6 cp6 cn6 q6 vdd vss fa_hold
XC7 ck t7 vin cp7 cn7 vdd vss fa_comp
XH7 cp7 cn7 q7 vdd vss fa_hold
* ---- thermometer to binary encoder ----
* b2 = q4; b1 = q2.!q4 + q6; b0 = q1.!q2 + q3.!q4 + q5.!q6 + q7
XE1 q2 n2 vdd vss fa_inv
XE2 q4 n4 vdd vss fa_inv
XE3 q6 n6 vdd vss fa_inv
XE4 q7 n7 vdd vss fa_inv
XE5 q2 n4 x1 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE6 n6 x1 b1 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE7 q5 n6 y1 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE8 q3 n4 y2 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE9 q1 n2 y3 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE10 n7 y1 y2 y3 b0 vdd vss fa_nand4
XE11 n4 b2 vdd vss fa_inv
.ends flash_adc_3bit
